<apex:page standardController="NOC__c" extensions="CapriNocPdfController"
           renderAs="pdf" showHeader="false" sidebar="false"
           standardStylesheets="false" applyHtmlTag="false" applyBodyTag="false">
    <html>
    <head>
        <style type="text/css">
            /* Layout follows "CAPRI CANCELLATION LETTER.docx"; the top margin leaves room for the letterhead.
               Add ?relatedId=(cancelled Booking Id) to print a cancellation other than the NOC's first one. */
            @page { size: A4; margin: 100pt 72pt 40pt 72pt; }
            body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: #000; line-height: 1.25; }
            p { margin: 0; text-align: left; }
            p.para { margin: 0 0 10pt 0; text-align: justify; }
            .gap { height: 12pt; }
            .right { text-align: right; }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!NOT(ISBLANK(errorMessage))}"><p>{!errorMessage}</p></apex:outputPanel>
        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!AND(ISBLANK(errorMessage), NOT(hasCancellation))}">
            <p>No cancellation is linked to this NOC.</p>
        </apex:outputPanel>
        <apex:outputPanel rendered="{!AND(ISBLANK(errorMessage), hasCancellation)}">
            <p class="right"><b>Date:&#160;<apex:outputText value="{0,date,dd MMMM, yyyy}"><apex:param value="{!TODAY()}"/></apex:outputText></b></p>
            <div class="gap">&#160;</div>
            <div class="gap">&#160;</div>
            <p>Capri Global Capital Limited</p>
            <p>502, Tower A,</p>
            <p>Peninsula Business Park,</p>
            <p>Senapati Bapat Marg,</p>
            <p>Lower Parel, Mumbai 400 013.</p>
            <div class="gap">&#160;</div>
            <p><b><u>Subject: Cancellation of Flat No: {!cancellationBooking.Plot__r.Name}</u></b></p>
            <div class="gap">&#160;</div>
            <p class="para" style="text-align:left">Dear Sir/Madam</p>
            <p class="para">With reference to inventory list provided along with the loan agreement between
                M/s. Capri Global Capital Limited and M/s. Ananda Homes dated 28-Jun-24; the flat no.
                <b>{!cancellationBooking.Plot__r.Name}</b> was sold unit (having area
                <b>{!cancellationBooking.Plot__r.Saleable_Area_Sft__c}</b> sq.ft.). We have received a request from the
                <b>{!cancellationBuyerNames}</b> dated&#160;<b><apex:outputText value="{0,date,dd/MM/yyyy}"><apex:param value="{!cancellationRequestDate}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                stating that they want to cancel the flat <b>{!cancellationBooking.Plot__r.Name}</b> on account of
                {!cancellationBooking.Cancellation_Reason__c}.</p>
            <p class="para">Flat No. <b>{!cancellationBooking.Plot__r.Name}</b> was tentatively allotted to
                <b>{!cancellationBuyerNames}</b> however we have neither entered into agreement to sale nor done the
                registration, and no NOC was obtained for the same.
                <apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!cancellationReceipts.hasReceipts}">
                    In totality, an amount of <b>Rs. {!cancellationReceipts.totalText}/-</b> was received from
                    {!cancellationReceipts.modes} No: <b>{!cancellationReceipts.references}</b> Dated:
                    <b>{!cancellationReceipts.dates}</b><apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!hasRefunds}">
                    and the entire amount has been refunded on&#160;<b><apex:outputText value="{0,date,dd-MM-yyyy}"><apex:param value="{!lastRefundDate}"/></apex:outputText></b>
                    vide Online No: <b>{!refundReferences}</b>, Dated: <b>{!refundDates}</b></apex:outputPanel>.
                </apex:outputPanel></p>
            <p class="para">On account of the above cancellation, we confirm that the flat no
                <b>{!cancellationBooking.Plot__r.Name}</b> shall form part of unsold inventory. Further, the same shall be
                subject to the same terms which are applicable to unsold inventory as per the loan agreement between
                M/s. Capri Global Capital Limited and M/s. Ananda Homes dated 28-Jun-24.</p>
            <p class="para">Attached herewith for your ready reference:</p>
            <p class="para" style="margin-left:36pt;text-indent:-21pt">1.&#160;&#160;&#160;Request mail for cancellation of flat by
                <b>{!cancellationBuyerNames}</b>.</p>
            <p class="para">Note: <b>{!cancellationBooking.Plot__r.Name}</b> flat was cancelled from
                <b>{!cancellationBuyerNames}</b> and it is allotted as New Booking to <b>{!buyerNames}</b>
                <apex:outputPanel layout="none" rendered="{!NOT(ISBLANK(buyerMobile))}">&#160;(Mobile: <b>{!buyerMobile}</b>)</apex:outputPanel>.</p>
            <div style="page-break-inside:avoid">
                <p><b>For M/s. Ananda Homes,</b></p>
                <div style="height:50pt">&#160;</div>
                <p><b>Authorised Signatory</b></p>
            </div>
        </apex:outputPanel>
    </body>
    </html>
</apex:page>
